            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/employees/{{userId}}/education/document",
            "description": "Upload file only → returns Cloudinary URL.\nDB save nahi hota.\n\nFrontend flow (Add Education form):\n1. User chooses file → POST this API → get document + documentName\n2. On Submit → PUT /api/employees/:id with education[] including that URL"
